data: {"id": "75e5ca97302c434c-thinking-parallel_evidence-574", "run_id": "75e5ca97302c434c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=597 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 5 completed, 0 in progress, 0 pending\n[✓] [1] kubectl_describe: 确认目标 Pod ", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788424948834, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_173347dd4c2d4d8f82b8c3b8", "tool_sequence": 8, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=597 lines=11\nInvestigation plan updated with 7 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 5 completed, 0 in progress, 0 pending\n[✓] [1] kubectl_describe: 确认目标 Pod 的当前状态、容器终态和近期事件\n[✓] [2] execute_pod_promql: 获取目标 Pod 的真实生命周期、等待原因、终止原因和重启指标\n[✓] [5] query_pod_topology: 获取目标 Pod 的拓扑关系\n[✓] [6] kubectl get yaml: 获取 Pod YAML 以确认 Secret 引用配置\n[✓] [7] kubectl describe secret: 检查 Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input 是否存在及 key\n[✗] [3] query_pod_logs: 获取目标 Pod 最近时间窗的真实日志\n[✗] [4] query_pod_tracing: 获取目标 Pod 的 DeepFlow 流量和 Tempo Span\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/75e5ca97302c434c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/75e5ca97302c434c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/75e5ca97302c434c-g1/tools/011-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

